abstract: "A mesh-free sculpting, simulation and rendering tool in which every form is an implicit field on a sparse, multi-level lattice. A dated research record: direction, published ingredients, mechanisms, measurements, failures and next steps. Code to follow separately under Apache-2.0."
keywords:
  - implicit surfaces
  - signed distance fields
  - digital sculpting
  - contact simulation
  - rendering
  - procedural generation
